Subject: [PATCH 9/9] axon7: ZteDoze from msm8996-common's lineage-22.2
 XiaomiParts

The 18.1 Android.mk app was XiaomiParts' doze code under other names.
Take the 22.2 version (Soong android_app on system_ext, LineageOS settings
resources, collapsing toolbar, direct boot, power-save whitelist) without
the Xiaomi button and key-handler parts.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
